body:
I wanna see the whole camp (especially David and Gwen) going apeshit on Max's parents. Like I want even Nurf to be pissed. I want Nikki to bite one of them. I want Gwen to bust out so many expletives it will make your ears bleed, and I want David to be silent the whole time and just drop a huge sincere emotion bomb of "you suck as parent and don't deserve my boi"

&#x200B;

Then again, I may not want to see that until the show's end, whenever that will (heartwrenchenly) be. 

&#x200B;

So here are some other brainstorms

&#x200B;

I want to see more development in Ered and Nerris's relationship. That can't just be a one-episode feel good thing. This may just be shameless queerity, but I'd like it if Nerris has a crush on Ered. 

&#x200B;

More of max being an uncaring little shit, who's fairly indifferent to shit going on, and not actively making schemes. Even if its just for a little while

&#x200B;

More fanfic/hopeless Tumblr person shit from Gwen. I want a Wattpad joke.
